48: /**
49:  * A simple leader election service, which selects a leader among contenders and notifies listeners.
50:  *
51:  * <p>An election service for contenders can be created via {@link #createLeaderElectionService()},
52:  * a listener service for leader observers can be created via {@link
53:  * #createLeaderRetrievalService()}.
